{
  "slug": "nitrosend-ai-first-email",
  "name": "Nitrosend Ai First Email",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-native email marketing for Claude. Compose emails, build automation flows, manage contacts, and send campaigns — all from your terminal. Powered by 20 MCP tools and an expert Email Marketer agent backed by a 65K-word knowledge base (908 sources, 4,798 insights across 19 industry playbooks).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**, **1 agent**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `analytics` (Inspect Nitrosend account, campaign, flow, or message performance and turn live metrics into bounded recommendations), `build-flow` (Build email/SMS automation flows with triggers, steps, waits, splits, and webhooks), `compose-email` (Create or edit email templates with Nitrosend's section-based designer), `email-marketing-bible` (Apply durable email-marketing principles without treating static benchmarks, laws, vendor features, or prices as current facts), `import-contacts` (Import contacts into Nitrosend from inline records or CSV), `send-campaign` (End-to-end campaign workflow: create, design, target audience, preview, test, approve, and send or schedule an email or SMS…), `send-transactional` (Send transactional emails or SMS for app-triggered communications: receipts, password resets, OTPs, order confirmations, shipping notifications, system alerts), `setup` (Guided Nitrosend onboarding)\n- **Agents** (1): `email-marketer` (Nitrosend email marketing operator)\n- **Hooks** (1): `hooks.json`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `nitrosend`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install nitrosend-ai-first-email@claude-community` from `nitrosend/claude`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 8,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
